	"data": "Hearth System Audit — 2026-05-02\n\nArchitecture\n\n✅ What's Working Well\nSpeaker recognition pipeline — ECAPA-TDNN + parallel STT, confidence-based access, continuous learning\nFallback chain — Health monitor (30s checks) sets flags → bridge routes to local Whisper/Piper\nService auto-restart — All services have Restart=on-failure or Restart=always\nMemory safety — Bridge clears audio_buffer each utterance, no leak; _last_audio_buffer holds only one copy\nGPU headroom — 2910 MiB used / 8192 MiB total…",
